# Line-ending and diff policy.
#
# Text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with the
# platform's native endings. Do not run a mass `git add --renormalize` unless
# you intend to rewrite history-wide line endings.
* text=auto

# Binary assets: never normalise or diff these as text.
*.wav  binary
*.vst3 binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
